<div class="text guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear List for Shadow Priest DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Twilight Protocol Dungeons and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Shadow Priest DPS Pre-Raid</h2>With Reforging added, BiS lists are not set in stone in the same way they once were. Most items can be replaced for similar items of the same item level, and generally a higher item level will be a better item with few exceptions.<br/>
<br/>The primary exceptions here are in regards to Hit and Haste. Equipping a higher item level piece that causes you to lose your Hit Cap is very rarely going to be worth it, but in a lot of cases some smart Reforging can fix this for you. For the first time, Haste is primarily worth it at various breakpoints, and falling between them for a small item level gain could be a DPS loss, but this is the kind of thing you will have to sim to figure out.<br/>
<br/>While there is a variety of different pieces that can be considered Pre-Raid BiS, some of them naturally end up being expensive BoEs, behind luck-based <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a> grinds, or cost several weeks worth of <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Due to this, the gear embed below has both an optimized and a more realistic setup to choose from, though most players will likely end up with something inbetween.<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
