<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points for Shadow Priest DPS Pre-Raid</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> are the Cataclysm version of Raid Emblems, which means that they can be obtained by killing bosses in Raids and completing Heroic Dungeons through the Random Dungeon Finder tool. The main vendors you can exchange these at to obtain gear are <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=46556/jamusvaz">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Jamus'Vaz</span></a> for the Horde and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=44245/faldren-tillsdale">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Faldren Tillsdale</span></a> for the Alliance.<br/>
<br/> There is a weekly cap of 1000 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, meaning any purchase using this currency will take multiple weeks to complete. With this in mind, it is recommended to prioritize your Tier pieces first. This cap carries over week to week, so you won't be falling behind on <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> if you missed the cap for one week. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77098/nanoprecise-cape">
<img alt="Nanoprecise Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nanoprecise Cape</span></a> makes the top of the list as you'll be using it for your best in slot down the road. There's no Tier to purchase this time around so you have room to choose for other off pieces based on what you're missing. We'd recommend taking a look at <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77114/bottled-wishes">
<img alt="Bottled Wishes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bottled Wishes</span></a> as it is very good early, but skip it if you find yourself lucky enough to have the Dragon Soul trinkets from Twilight Protocol dungeons.<br/>
<br/>Also keep in mind that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77177/splinterfoot-sandals">
<img alt="Splinterfoot Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Splinterfoot Sandals</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77324/chronoboost-bracers">
<img alt="Chronoboost Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chronoboost Bracers</span></a> are bind on equip, so if you have some gold lying around you can think about spending it on these pieces over spending <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
