<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Shadow Priest DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-shadow-priest-dps">Head for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>With the addition of Twilight Protocol Dungeons you will want to try and grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78798/hood-of-dying-light">
<img alt="Hood of Dying Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hood of Dying Light</span></a>. You want to opt for Tier 13 as soon as possible as the set bonus gives us a huge benefit. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=76152/cowl-of-destiny">
<img alt="Cowl of Destiny" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_dungeonrobe_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cowl of Destiny</span></a> is also introduced as of Phase 4. It only requires you to complete the questline ending with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="quest" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/quest=30096/murozond">
<img alt="Murozond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Murozond</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
<img alt="Arcanum of Hyjal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Hyjal</span></a>, requires <span class="rep-revered">Revered</span> reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
