<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-shadow-priest-dps">Shoulders for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>With Twilight Protocol Dungeons now being available, you will want to try and grab your Tier pieces.<br/>
<br/>You can't go wrong with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72825/mantle-of-time">
<img alt="Mantle of Time" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_robe_dungeonrobe_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Time</span></a> from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=54432/murozond">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Murozond</span></a>, but I wouldn't break any set bonuses over it.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62343/greater-inscription-of-charged-lodestone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone</span></a>, requires <span class="rep-exalted">Exalted</span> reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>, or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86403/felfire-inscription">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_mastersinscription.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Felfire Inscription</span></a> - Only Scribes may apply Inscription specific shoulder enchants on their own Shoulders.<div class="pad"></div>
