<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-shadow-priest-dps">Chest for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>Another slot that is dominated by the fact that <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=1067/regalia-of-dying-light">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of Dying Light</span></a> can be obtained from Twilight Protocol dungeons. If you have an excess of <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a> you can divert some spending to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78380/robe-of-glowing-stone">
<img alt="Robe of Glowing Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robe of Glowing Stone</span></a> to help until you get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78826/robes-of-dying-light">
<img alt="Robes of Dying Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Dying Light</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
