<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-shadow-priest-dps">Wrist for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>If you have gold to spend, I would highly recommend purchasing <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71990/dreamwraps-of-the-light">
<img alt="Dreamwraps of the Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamwraps of the Light</span></a>. You can also pick up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77324/chronoboost-bracers">
<img alt="Chronoboost Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chronoboost Bracers</span></a> since it is bind on equip. However, given that it costs Valor Points, you will not be able to pick that up until later in Phase 4.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Intellect</span></a> for Leatherworkers, otherwise <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68786/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
<img alt="Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect</span></a>.<br/>Blacksmiths may apply additional Sockets on their own Bracers with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55628/socket-bracer">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_socketedbracer.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Bracer</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
