<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-shadow-priest-dps">Hands for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>Ideally, you won't be using this slot for Tier 13. Depending on how much you play, you'll see <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78777/gloves-of-dying-light">
<img alt="Gloves of Dying Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_pants_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of Dying Light</span></a> before you have the Valor Points to buy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77157/the-hands-of-gilly">
<img alt="The Hands of Gilly" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_pants_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Hands of Gilly</span></a>. You can also buy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78466/gloves-of-liquid-smoke">
<img alt="Gloves of Liquid Smoke" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_pants_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of Liquid Smoke</span></a> for Obsidian Fragments if you're unlucky on drops in your Twilight Protocol Dungeons.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74198/enchant-gloves-haste">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Haste</span></a> with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> for Engineers.<br/>Blacksmiths may apply additional Sockets on their own Bracers with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55641/socket-gloves">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Gloves</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
