<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-shadow-priest-dps">Legs for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>Another Tier slot covered by Twilight Protocl Dungeons, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78817/leggings-of-dying-light">
<img alt="Leggings of Dying Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Dying Light</span></a>. We can also recommend <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71980/lavaquake-legwraps">
