<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-shadow-priest-dps">Feet for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77177/splinterfoot-sandals">
<img alt="Splinterfoot Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Splinterfoot Sandals</span></a> is a very solid option, and while bind on equip, will probably be expensive until people have more time to get Valor. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69953/endless-dream-walkers">
<img alt="Endless Dream Walkers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidpriest_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Endless Dream Walkers</span></a> is a lot cheaper of an item to hold you over until you get some Valor. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=76158/courtiers-slippers">
<img alt="Courtier's Slippers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_dungeonrobe_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Courtier's Slippers</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72836/slippers-of-wizardry">
<img alt="Slippers of Wizardry" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_dungeonrobe_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Slippers of Wizardry</span></a> are also viable options, both coming from the new dungeons from Phase 4.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74199/enchant-boots-haste">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Haste</span></a>
