<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Shadow Priest DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-shadow-priest-dps">Neck for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>While the Valor item in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77088/opal-of-the-secret-order">
<img alt="Opal of the Secret Order" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Opal of the Secret Order</span></a> is very good, the second option <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78382/petrified-fungal-heart">
<img alt="Petrified Fungal Heart" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Petrified Fungal Heart</span></a> from Twilight Protocols is also very good and the difference between the two is very slight. We would recommend targeting either of those two items as a priority.<div class="pad"></div>
