<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-shadow-priest-dps">Rings for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>You could absolutely dump all of your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> into rings, but I strongly recommend you instead aim for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78496/signet-of-suturing">
<img alt="Signet of Suturing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_104.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of Suturing</span></a> from Twilight Protocol Dungeons and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=76153/signet-of-the-twilight-prophet">
<img alt="Signet of the Twilight Prophet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_101.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Twilight Prophet</span></a> from the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="quest" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/quest=30105/the-twilight-prophet">
<img alt="The Twilight Prophet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Twilight Prophet</span></a> quest and upgrade the rings later. The best part about it being from a quest is that it is guarenteed!<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: Enchanters Only - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74217/enchant-ring-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Intellect</span></a>
