<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-shadow-priest-dps">Trinkets for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>Trinkets are complicated, there are a lot of variables to consider. For best results, I recommend always simming trinket combos not just picking blindly.<br/>
<br/>This time around since ilvl 384 and 390 trinkets are obtainable from Obsidian Fragments, there are a lot of juicy options. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77975/will-of-unbinding">
<img alt="Will of Unbinding" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Will of Unbinding</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77980/cunning-of-the-cruel">
<img alt="Cunning of the Cruel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_coin_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cunning of the Cruel</span></a> are both very good trinkets that will carry you well into Dragon Soul. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69110/variable-pulse-lightning-capacitor">
<img alt="Variable Pulse Lightning Capacitor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_trinket_naxxramas06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Variable Pulse Lightning Capacitor</span></a> is also extremely good and very competitive with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77980/cunning-of-the-cruel">
<img alt="Cunning of the Cruel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_coin_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cunning of the Cruel</span></a>. There is also the comparable option in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77114/bottled-wishes">
<img alt="Bottled Wishes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bottled Wishes</span></a> from Valor Points if you're looking for a burst trinket and it also has good progression value on Spine of Deathwing.<div class="pad"></div>
