<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Shadow Priest DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="staves-for-shadow-priest-dps">Staves for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>No longer must the Priests dig in the mines, hoping for an Archaeology staff. Now with our new friend, Twilight Protocol Dungeons, you too can be the proud owner of a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78486/titahk-the-steps-of-time">
<img alt="Ti'tahk, the Steps of Time" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ti'tahk, the Steps of Time</span></a>. There are also some nice options from Hour of Twilight and End Time in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72836/slippers-of-wizardry">
<img alt="Slippers of Wizardry" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_dungeonrobe_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Slippers of Wizardry</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72808/jainas-staff">
<img alt="Jaina's Staff" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_430future_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jaina's Staff</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74242/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
