<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-shadow-priest-dps">Main Hand Weapons for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>We are in a unique situation where LFR weapons from Madness of Deathwing are available from Obsidian Fragments, making <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78484/rathrak-the-poisonous-mind">
