<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hands-for-shadow-priest-dps">Off-Hands for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78441/ledger-of-revolting-rituals">
<img alt="Ledger of Revolting Rituals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_1h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ledger of Revolting Rituals</span></a> is your best option and is easily obtainable from Obsidian Fragments. If you have gold laying around and you can find it, we would also recommend taking a look at <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71022/goblet-of-anger">
<img alt="Goblet of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_1h_firelandsraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Goblet of Anger</span></a>, although it will be slightly worse.<br/>
